<title>POLAND: Polish shares end lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Budimex, Stalexport and Universal closed lower and Bank Slaski Rolimpex were flat in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The remaining five stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>Turnover fell to 0.8 million zlotys from 2.4 million zlotys on Monday.</p>
<p>NFI units fell in 19.8-million-zloty trade.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
